      "date": "1976-04-01",
      "kind": "occupancy",
      "description": "The three-storey frame house, fitted out as a half-way house, was lived in by several people and held offices of the American Friends Service Committee — its Central Committee for Conscientious Objectors and a criminal justice project.",
