    {
      "date": "1976-04-08",
      "kind": "planning decision",
      "description": "Against the staff's recommendation, the City Planning Commission unanimously authorized the American Friends Service Committee to use five rooms of the house as offices for its social welfare projects, for five years (Resolution 7475).",
